---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import WorkExplorer from '../components/WorkExplorer.astro';
import StoryScene from '../components/StoryScene.astro';
import OfferFlow from '../components/OfferFlow.astro';
import StudioSites from '../components/StudioSites.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
import {projects} from '../data/projects';
const pick=(ids:string[])=>ids.map(id=>projects.find(p=>p.id===id)!);
/* zenith is maintenance work, not a build, so it sits with the upkeep beat and not on the laptop */
const built=pick(['orias','gawangdiwa','cowmit']), steps=pick(['balzy','artin','komforten','zenith']), wired=pick(['vendrato']);
/* what each related project is in its beat's line; falls back to the project's own type */
const builtWords:string[]=[], stepsWords=['The advertorial','The product page','The store and checkout','Kept running after launch'], wiredWords=['Site, CRM and booking, joined up'];
/* Sites from Vendrato, where Marv is a partner and consultant: studio work, not his own builds. Client sites first, then concept
   studies (design proposals for real businesses), one per trade. */
const sites=[
 {slug:'ushh',name:'Urdaneta Sacred Heart Hospital',trade:'Healthcare',kind:'Hospital site with doctor search',client:true},
 {slug:'japanese4x4',path:'japanese-4x4',name:'Japanese 4x4',trade:'Trucks and equipment',kind:'Truck and equipment inventory',client:true},
 {slug:'createinsubic',path:'create-in-subic',name:'Create in Subic',trade:'Creative spaces',kind:'Creative house and community',client:true},
 {slug:'smiths-fencing',name:'Smiths Fencing and Gates',trade:'Construction',kind:'Fences shown by type, from an owner-operator'},
 {slug:'mountain-paradise',name:'Mountain Paradise Landscaping',trade:'Landscaping',kind:'Opens on a hand-drawn garden plan'},
 {slug:'pestman-tasmania',name:'Shearwater Pest Management',trade:'Pest control',kind:'Illustrated like a field guide'},
 {slug:'nkh-solicitors',name:'Nelson Keane & Hemingway Lawyers',trade:'Law',kind:'Rural legal matters, shown through the land'},
 {slug:'newcorppools',name:'Newcorp Pools',trade:'Pool builders',kind:'Two ways to buy a pool, side by side'},
 {slug:'deonshaw',name:'Deon Shaw Concreting',trade:'Concreting',kind:'The same job before and after the pour'},
 {slug:'hoopertrees',name:'Hooper Trees',trade:'Tree services',kind:'Emergency call first, services to scale'},
 {slug:'mcgarchitects',name:'MCG Architects',trade:'Architecture',kind:'Follows the roofline into each project'},
].map(x=>({...x,client:!!x.client,href:`https://vendrato.com/${x.client?'case-studies':'concept-studies'}/${(x as any).path??x.slug}/`}));
---
<Site title="Websites, and what happens after the click" description="Marv Pacinabao is a partner and consultant at Vendrato. He builds websites and storefronts and connects them to the CRM, booking, automations and tracking behind them.">
<section class="st-story" id="st-story">
<StoryScene/>
<div class="st-beats">
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h1>Websites, and what happens after the click.</h1><p class="st-lede">I’m Marv, a partner and consultant at Vendrato. I build websites and storefronts, then connect them to the CRM, booking, automations and tracking that turn a visit into a customer.</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="button button-blue" href="https://vendrato.com/book">Book a free call</a><a class="button st-ghost" href="#selected-work">See the work</a></div></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat" id="story"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>I learned to check things twice.</h2><p>My first trade was aircraft maintenance and inspection. You follow the checklist, you troubleshoot in order, and you never sign off on something you didn’t look at. I left the trade. The habit came with me.</p><a class="text-link" href="/aviation/">My aviation background</a></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>Then I wanted to make the thing myself.</h2><p>After a stretch doing outreach and partnerships at a startup, I learned HTML, CSS and JavaScript by hand. Page builders came later. When Elementor or a Shopify section misbehaves now, I know where to look.</p><p class="st-line-label">Built this way</p><ol class="st-stops" data-n={built.length}>{built.map((p,i)=><li><a data-project={p.id} href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><span class="st-board"><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/></span><span class="st-post"></span><span class="st-rung"></span><b>{p.name}</b><span class="st-word">{builtWords[i]??p.kind}</span></a></li>)}<li class="st-marble" aria-hidden="true"></li></ol></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>A page is one step, not the whole trip.</h2><p>Supporting a Sweden-based brand, I built Shopify pages, kept Funnelish funnels updated, handled translations and ran QA before campaigns. A page sits between an ad and a checkout. I build it knowing both sides.</p><p class="st-line-label">Pages along the way</p><ol class="st-stops" data-n={steps.length}>{steps.map((p,i)=><li><a data-project={p.id} href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><span class="st-board"><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/></span><span class="st-post"></span><span class="st-rung"></span><b>{p.name}</b><span class="st-word">{stepsWords[i]??p.kind}</span></a></li>)}<li class="st-marble" aria-hidden="true"></li></ol></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>Then it has to connect to something.</h2><p>A page that takes an enquiry and stops there is half a job. The other half is what nobody sees: GoHighLevel pipelines and workflows, booking and reminders, Make and n8n automations, and the tracking that shows which ad paid for itself. I build that with <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/">Vendrato</a>, the web, automation and AI studio where I’m a partner and consultant.</p><p class="st-line-label">Where it connects</p><ol class="st-stops" data-n={wired.length}>{wired.map((p,i)=><li><a data-project={p.id} href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><span class="st-board"><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/></span><span class="st-post"></span><span class="st-rung"></span><b>{p.name}</b><span class="st-word">{wiredWords[i]??p.kind}</span></a></li>)}<li class="st-marble" aria-hidden="true"></li></ol></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>So I’m more than the person who builds the page.</h2><p>With the studio, I work across the website, the CRM behind it and the automations between them, so nothing is lost in a handover. When you book a call, I’m one of the people you’ll talk to.</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="button st-ghost" href="#what-i-do">See what I offer</a></div></div></div></div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="wrap home-reel" id="selected-work"><WorkExplorer/><div class="work-archive-link"><p>Eight projects. Different brands. My attention to the details.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/">Explore all projects</a></div></div>
<section class="st-offers" id="what-i-do"><div class="wrap">
<div class="st-head"><h2>What I can build for you.</h2><p>I’m a partner and consultant at Vendrato. This is the work I build with the studio, for the businesses we take on.</p></div>
<OfferFlow/>
<StudioSites sites={sites}/>
<p class="st-also">The studio also builds <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/voice-ai">voice AI</a> and <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/app-development">custom apps</a>, so you can add to the system without starting again with someone new.</p>
<dl class="st-facts"><div><dt>First</dt><dd>A free 30-minute call about your business and current setup</dd></div><div><dt>Then</dt><dd>A written scope and timeline, with weekly demos</dd></div><div><dt>At launch</dt><dd>Your code, accounts and documentation, in your name</dd></div></dl>
</div></section>
<ContactBand/>
</Site>
